WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Open the top menu drawer

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Select Cloud API

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Connect to WiFi

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Click on "Generate pairing code" to initiate pairing of your SOLO device

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Use the generated pairing code to pair your device
